{"turn_id": "d13-t1", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "resource_pair", "text": "该多语种语义角色标注器（polyglot semantic role labeler）通过结合 CoNLL 2009 共享任务中一对语言的资源来构建。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "针对 CoNLL 2009 数据集中每种语言的解析器，除了传统的单语版本外，还有额外纳入该数据集中英语部分监督信息的变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "seven_languages", "text": "系统在 CoNLL-2009 共享任务的语义角色标注部分全部七种语言（加泰罗尼亚语、汉语、捷克语、英语、德语、日语和西班牙语）上进行评估。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}, {"key": "no_parallel_data", "text": "该做法在没有平行数据、且各语言标注之间存在差异的情况下仍然实现了性能提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d13-t2", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "conll2009_pair_resources", "text": "论文的做法是将 CoNLL 2009 shared task 中一对语言的资源相结合，构建一个 polyglot 语义角色标注器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "论文为 CoNLL 2009 数据集中的每种语言训练解析器：传统单语版本，以及额外融入该数据集英语部分监督信息的变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "seven_languages", "text": "论文在 CoNLL-2009 shared task 的语义角色标注部分、全部七种语言（加泰罗尼亚语、中文、捷克语、英语、德语、日语和西班牙语）上进行评估。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}, {"key": "no_parallel_data", "text": "论文称，在没有平行数据且语言间标注存在差异的情况下，其方法在多种语言上的 SRL 性能仍优于单语基线。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "low_resource_advantage", "text": "论文指出，polyglot 训练可以得到比单语解析器更好的标注准确率，对低资源语言尤其如此，并且分析显示 polyglot 模型在较低资源设置下具有优势。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "sharing_via_parameter_sharing", "text": "论文认为，该设置下 polyglot 训练的成功表明，跨语言共享统计强度不依赖于标注约定上的显式对齐，可以仅通过参数共享实现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "no_alignments_needed", "text": "论文结论称，使用多语言词向量并跨语言合并训练数据，可以在没有跨语言对齐、共享标注或平行数据的情况下实现共享。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "label_space_heterogeneity", "text": "论文指出，CoNLL 2009 的语义标签空间完全是各语言特有的，这使其任务更具挑战性，捷克语和日语各有自己独特的论元标签集，大多与英语或彼此之间没有明确对应关系。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
